<title>USA: CPI Corp Q2 July 20 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>CPI Corp Q2 July 20 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.06   profit	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net loss		     813   profit	 2,252</p>
